<title>UK: Maiden pretax profit rises to 7.95 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Maiden pretax profit rises to 7.95 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		   13.6		vs   na</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	     3.6		vs   na</p>
<p> Pretax			   7.95	     vs   2.98</p>
<p> Turnover			55.10	     vs  36.52</p>
<p>NOTE - The pretax profit has not taken exceptional costs into account. The turnover includes acquisitions of 2.16 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Maiden Group Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
